      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ol><li>\n<p>Submitted [</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>From the district of Minyat Sandabas\u1e6d al-Qad\u012bma</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>By Mu\u1e25ammad b. Ibr\u0101h\u012bm, acting as deputy for Ab\u016b al-\u1e24usayn b. \u1e24amza, [&hellip;] delivered on behalf of his father</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The two current installments due to the d\u012bw\u0101n al-[&hellip;] (al-sa\u02bf\u012bd/al-qand?) from the assessed revenues of the granaries granted to them [as iq\u1e6d\u0101\u02bf]</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>For the year 520, under the supervision of the am\u012br al-Mukhlis Sad\u012bd al-Mulk</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>And [&hellip;] from Ab\u016b Man\u1e63\u016br [&hellip;], and the shaykh Ab\u016b al-Barak\u0101t</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Ya\u1e25y\u0101 b. Ya\u1e25y\u0101 b. Sal\u0101ma, administrator on behalf of Ya\u1e25y\u0101 b. Fa\u1e0dl, and Shadd \u1e24us\u0101m al-Dawla Najm al-D\u012bn</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>[&hellip;] according to the regulation of the grain depots/warehouses in Fus\u1e6d\u0101\u1e6d, on condition that a legal receipt be taken from the aforementioned headman.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>[&hellip;] acknowledging receipt according to established practice.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;In gold, free from deduction</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;And [&hellip;] three hundred [&hellip;] loads.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;..</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;\u1e62afar</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;.God willing</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;&hellip;&hellip;&hellip;.On the [&hellip;] of Jum\u0101d\u0101 I, year 521</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;Praise be to God alone, and peace</p>\n</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
